      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠰᠥᠮᠠᠺᠠᠯᠵᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>sümekelǰekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>сү(ү)мэлзэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>SYMEGELZE-</transcript>
      <definition>[= symelze-] v.i. To become pale (as of flowers), not very clear; to become obscure, darkened; to be dimly visible, loom.</definition>
      <page>743</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠥᠮᠠᠺᠠᠯᠵᠠᠨ ᠨᠣᠴᠤᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n nocuxu</transcript>
          <definition> To burn dimly; to flicker.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠥᠮᠠᠺᠠᠯᠵᠠᠨ ᠬᠠᠷᠠᠭᠳᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n xaraγdaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To appear indistinctly, loom up.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠣᠳᠤᠨ ᠤ ᠰᠥᠮᠠᠺᠠᠯᠵᠠᠺᠦ ᠭᠡᠷᠡᠯ ᠳ᠋‍‍ᠤ‍ᠷ</unicode>
          <transcript>odun u --ky gerel dyr</transcript>
          <definition> Under the twinkling stars.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
